OL,3,ARacial bias in London music licensing,
OL,4,Areport says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlack-led music events in London face
OL,7,Fdisproportionate restrictions and
OL,8,Fcancellations because of "racial bias"
OL,9,Fin licensing and policing, a report has
OL,10,Fconcluded.
OL,12,FThe Race Equality in Music Event
OL,13,FLicensing (REMEL) report, commissioned
OL,14,Fby the Greater London Authority, said
OL,15,Fthat black-led events were blocked at
OL,16,Fhigher rates than white-led events in
OL,17,Fthe capital, and South Asian-led events
OL,18,Falso faced restrictions.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
PN,16802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
