OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F168A1791995092
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARacial bias in London music licensing,
OL,4,Areport says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said genres including
OL,7,FAfrobeats, hip-hop, drill, R&B and
OL,8,Fdancehall were routinely flagged as
OL,9,F"high risk", while indie, pop and rock
OL,10,Fnights faced less scrutiny.
OL,12,FCameron Leslie, chairman of the mayor's
OL,13,FLondon Nightlife Taskforce, welcomed
OL,14,Fthe report and its recommendations.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
